{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00260",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 5.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Good morning. Come in, have a seat. Sorry about the wait, we're running a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.97,
      "end_seconds": 11.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Oh, that's fine. I was just reading something on my phone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.17,
      "end_seconds": 17.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.74,
      "end_seconds": 26.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a fever. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.37,
      "end_seconds": 30.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.9,
      "end_seconds": 41.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "About... well, two weeks. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.12,
      "end_seconds": 45.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.33,
      "end_seconds": 66.39,
      "duration_seconds": 19.06,
      "text": "It's, It's a few times a day. So, I've had a runny nose too, for three days. I've also had a sore throat. As for mild headache, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About mild headache, it's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.9,
      "end_seconds": 71.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.87,
      "end_seconds": 72.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.4,
      "end_seconds": 90.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any chest pain or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.19,
      "end_seconds": 92.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.22,
      "end_seconds": 98.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Any burning when passing urine, rash, shortness of breath or diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.23,
      "end_seconds": 101.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Um, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.82,
      "end_seconds": 104.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.07,
      "end_seconds": 107.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.23,
      "end_seconds": 114.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.53,
      "end_seconds": 116.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.88,
      "end_seconds": 120.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.24,
      "end_seconds": 124.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, um, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 126.09,
      "end_seconds": 132.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 38.8, pulse is 96 beats a minute, pressure 123 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 140.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Do you have any known allergies at all? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.71,
      "end_seconds": 142.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.53,
      "end_seconds": 145.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.88,
      "end_seconds": 147.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.22,
      "end_seconds": 151.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.56,
      "end_seconds": 152.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.86,
      "end_seconds": 164.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.45,
      "end_seconds": 172.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "My mother had high blood pressure. Well, my father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 179.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.57,
      "end_seconds": 190.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "It's Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma. I took the morning off to come in today. I take Glycomet, 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.63,
      "end_seconds": 195.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.82,
      "end_seconds": 197.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.91,
      "end_seconds": 202.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.82,
      "end_seconds": 206.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Um, no problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.95,
      "end_seconds": 212.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.24,
      "end_seconds": 230.84,
      "duration_seconds": 16.6,
      "text": "I have asthma. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. Diabetes, for two years. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.38,
      "end_seconds": 235.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I see. Okay, diabetes, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.01,
      "end_seconds": 240.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.22,
      "end_seconds": 243.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.52,
      "end_seconds": 266.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "The glands in your neck feel a little tender but not big."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.04,
      "end_seconds": 271.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.55,
      "end_seconds": 284.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Chest is clear when I listen, no crackles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.46,
      "end_seconds": 289.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.23,
      "end_seconds": 313.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Your throat looks red at the back, but there's no pus on the tonsils."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.86,
      "end_seconds": 338.5,
      "duration_seconds": 22.64,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Putting it all together, this looks most like a viral illness. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be influenza, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.85,
      "end_seconds": 344.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.91,
      "end_seconds": 363.1,
      "duration_seconds": 17.19,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a viral illness, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a fever for two weeks, and no shortness of breath or burning when passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.39,
      "end_seconds": 366.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.44,
      "end_seconds": 370.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.38,
      "end_seconds": 372.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.04,
      "end_seconds": 393.48,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'm going to order blood tests, for fever. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Let's get a throat swab, for sore throat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.18,
      "end_seconds": 395.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.04,
      "end_seconds": 407.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "I'll start you on cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for five days. That's for blocked nose. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.24,
      "end_seconds": 411.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.76,
      "end_seconds": 426.08,
      "duration_seconds": 14.32,
      "text": "Stay home, rest, and keep the fluids up. Warm soups and water, anything that goes down easily. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.08,
      "end_seconds": 431.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.99,
      "end_seconds": 439.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 439.98,
      "end_seconds": 441.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.75,
      "end_seconds": 450.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "Come back if it's not settling in three days. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 451.61,
      "end_seconds": 462.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "So, you know, I take the cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night and come back if it's not settling in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 463.02,
      "end_seconds": 465.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 467.48,
      "end_seconds": 471.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}